// Public-release copy guard: hold publication while a release note bound for a
// public surface has copy nobody has validated. PUBLIC_CANDIDATE is 1 when the
// candidate is going somewhere outside the organisation; COPY_VALIDATED is 1
// once the text itself has passed whatever check the host requires - a human
// read, a link check, a claims review.
// This is the second half of PUBLIC_RELEASE_NOT_PROVEN. Baseline Nano IR
// carries an and-chain and has no `or` node, so the disjunction "no proof or
// no validated copy" is two entries; aether_release_notes_proof_missing is the
// first. Both map to the same reason code, and deploying one without the other
// deploys half a guard.
// This rule gates release-note publication and nothing else. It must never be
// wired to a branch, a deploy, or an engineering merge: unreviewed copy is a
// reason not to publish a claim, never a reason to block engineering work.
// REGIME: all of them, for public surfaces only. An internal candidate has
// PUBLIC_CANDIDATE 0 and this rule is silent on it by construction.
// CONDITIONS: the host publishes COPY_VALIDATED 0 until a validation has
// actually run. A default of 1 makes this rule vacuous and the vacuity is
// invisible from outside, because a rule that never fires and a rule with
// nothing to report look identical.
// INVALIDATION: the validation completing. The rule proposes a hold; it does
// not latch and does not decide when the hold ends.
// SHAPE: 5m, matching the rest of the release-note family so one batch is
// evaluated by every rule on the same tick.
// NOT aether_release_notes_proof_missing: that is the other half of the same
// disjunction and asks whether the evidence can be fetched. This one asks
// whether anybody read the words.
// CALIBRATED ON: nothing numeric; both comparisons are against host booleans.
// What does not travel is what validation means - a one-person read and a
// formal claims review both publish the same 1, and the host owns which it is.
strategy AetherReleaseNotesCopyUnvalidated {

    agent ReleaseDesk

    every 5m {

        if PUBLIC_CANDIDATE >= 1 and COPY_VALIDATED <= 0 {

            pause()

        }

    }

}
